WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.440
On the code side: the
sample's mapping validates,

3
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:09.038
the pinned copy is unchanged and
reviewed, production goes through the

4
00:00:09.038 --> 00:00:13.325
hardened client, both clients pass,
and new rules refuse by default.

5
00:00:13.325 --> 00:00:18.052
On the run side: the hold and the budget
are set from your own numbers and license,

6
00:00:18.052 --> 00:00:20.670
the sender has one
permission and no secret,

7
00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:23.360
the quarantine file
stays in the audit store,

8
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:28.087
every missing person key becomes a finding,
and the endpoint matches the cloud.

9
00:00:28.087 --> 00:00:31.549
Chapter 2 builds Graph clients
for the government clouds.

10
00:00:31.549 --> 00:00:32.710
Thanks for watching.
